# Optional, public form destination. Never put a secret in a VITE_ variable.
# No endpoint is configured by default: the form prepares an email draft.
# Accepted: https://formspree.io/f/<approved-form-id> or /api/<your-inquiry-handler>
# The handler must validate and rate-limit server-side and return JSON:
# {"ok":true} or {"success":true}, only once the inquiry has been accepted.
# VITE_INQUIRY_ENDPOINT=
